    "Actual restart policy in our docker-compose.yml has not been verified.",
    "Crash-loop frequency and time-to-recovery have not been measured.",
    "Team's definition of 'self-healing' (process restart vs. application-level recovery) is undefined.",
    "No evidence that the backend recovers state or resolves the failure cause after restart."
